<title>POLAND: BOS JAN NET RISES TO PLN 6.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS JAN NET RISES TO PLN 6.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.18 vs    2.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.38 vs    6.48</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 13.60 vs    8.92</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	17.91 vs   18.19</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
